  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 401.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 401.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 485-C:11 relative to establishing best management practices for activities that are potential contamination sources, which are to be followed when using, storing, or otherwise handling regulated substances to minimize the risk of groundwater contamination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 401) #8786, eff 1-5-07; ss by #10828, eff 5-19-15; ss by #14345, eff 8-23-25, EXPIRES: 8-23-35",
